# Separate Hebrew / English prompts

When the effective reply language is **Hebrew**, all instructional system-prompt copy must be Hebrew — block titles, craft rules, grounding, humor DNA, rewrite nudges, automations, recovery. Do not mix English scaffolding into a Hebrew reply prompt.

When the effective reply language is **English**, use English instructional copy.

- Hebrew strings live in `apps/api/src/ai/hebrew-reply-style.ts` (or a clear Hebrew sibling helper).
- Prefer `promptIsHebrew(ctx)` / `effectiveReplyLanguage(...)` branches over one bilingual blob.
- Tests should assert Hebrew prompts do not contain English rule phrases (and English prompts do not contain Hebrew rule phrases) for any new prompt surface.
